  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SuperRich Micro Hydro Power Plant Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SuperRichwill install three innovative hybrid hydro-solar systems onthe Zambezi River; the first of 12 units which will ultimately have a generational capacity of 60 kilowatts. The systems utilize a unique floating turbine technology which floats on the surface of the river and does not require extensivecivil works.</narrative>
  </description>
